acts that are complete. The rider still carries the charge (payment_status CHARGED, refund_issued_sgd 0.00, total_charged 17.81 SGD). Because the contested amount is 3.00 SGD, below POL-GEN-22's 10.00 SGD threshold, and both profiles carry fraud_flags 0, this ruling is final at AI level; POL-RD-25's 2 km ceiling is not in force (thresholds.ai_ruling_max_deviation_applied is false) and 1.30 km is under 2 km in any event. Outcome for the filing rider: PARTIAL_REFUND of 0.94 SGD (POL-GEN-03)."
